OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's free transport pilot a
OL,4,Asuccess - but council cannot afford to
OL,5,Awiden it
OL,6,
OL,7,FA review of a free public transport
OL,8,Ftrial in Glasgow has hailed the pilot
OL,9,Fas highly successful - but found the
OL,10,Fcity council cannot afford to fund a
OL,11,Fwider scheme.
OL,13,FAlmost 1,000 people, aged between 22
OL,14,Fand 59, were given unlimited travel on
OL,15,Fbuses, ScotRail trains and the Subway
OL,16,Ffor six weeks, starting in February
OL,17,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
