OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's free transport pilot a
OL,4,Asuccess - but council cannot afford to
OL,5,Awiden it
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficials reported the fare-free travel
OL,8,Fencouraged drivers to leave their cars
OL,9,Fbehind, cut everyday costs and helped
OL,10,Fpeople reach work or health
OL,11,Fappointments.
OL,13,FHowever, the pilot scheme cost #225,000
OL,14,Fto go ahead and the report said a wider
OL,15,Finitiative "would be outwith the
OL,16,Fability of the council to fund".
